# Quick Start

Send your first device command in under 5 minutes.

Prerequisites
Python 3.10+
SmartTouch source code
Local environment configured

Step 1: Install and Run
cd SmartTouch
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload

Step 2: Authenticate
curl -X POST <http://localhost:8000/auth/token>
Step 3: Discover Devices
curl <http://localhost:8000/devices>
Step 4: Send Your First Command
curl -X POST <http://localhost:8000/devices/gate01/commands>
Step 5: Explore Swagger UI
<http://localhost:8000/docs>
